1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,900
PoseBusters showed it in 2024.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,900
Before: an input,

3
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,600
a model,

4
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,500
a confident score,

5
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,200
and the wrong pose. The score stays high.

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,500
With the harness:

7
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,800
it checks the inputs, the physics and the chemistry,

8
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:30,500
and returns a verdict with its evidence.

9
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:35,450
Our benchmark: 12 Boltz-2 poses with the pocket broken.

10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,900
On the score alone, the agent called all 12 valid.

11
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:45,050
With the harness fact file, it rejected all 12.

12
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,250
The reason is in the facts: lost contacts, a failed PoseBusters test.

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:53,300
The score never showed it.

14
00:00:54,096 --> 00:00:58,669
New run: pick from the menus.

15
00:00:58,819 --> 00:01:03,537
Each pick is looked up live.

16
00:01:03,687 --> 00:01:14,411
Four tools, five seeds.

17
00:01:14,561 --> 00:01:18,650
Start run is not pressed here.

18
00:01:19,446 --> 00:01:21,499
Finished run: seven tools, 164 structures.

19
00:01:21,649 --> 00:01:25,425
Verdict and issues, each with its value.

20
00:01:25,575 --> 00:01:31,129
The Boltz-2 medoid, rendered with PyMOL.

21
00:01:31,279 --> 00:01:41,157
GPU time per seed on Modal A100.

22
00:01:41,955 --> 00:01:53,557
Ensemble: 164 structures, each with its values.

23
00:01:54,352 --> 00:02:04,581
Every verdict carries its evidence.

24
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:07,626
The document: one printable report per run.

25
00:02:07,776 --> 00:02:15,827
Downloads: run record, report and provenance graph.

26
00:02:15,977 --> 00:02:20,247
Key numbers, then the structure.

27
00:02:20,397 --> 00:02:29,683
Figures: seed spread, check outcomes, PoseBusters.

28
00:02:29,833 --> 00:02:37,263
Error map, provenance graph, interactions.

29
00:02:38,057 --> 00:02:40,463
Agents call the same API.

